{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
		"name": "Irembo Notifications API",
		"description": "Complete API collection for demonstrating the Irembo Notifications Rate Limiting System.\n\n**Features Demonstrated:**\n- Multi-tier rate limiting (soft throttle + hard reject)\n- API Key authentication\n- Admin API with Basic Auth\n- Standard error responses\n- Rate limit headers\n- Observability endpoints\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Ensure Docker Compose is running: `docker-compose up -d`\n2. Wait for services to be healthy (check /actuator/health)\n3. Use the pre-configured environment variables\n\n**Demo Flow:**\n1. Health Check\n2. Send valid notifications (observe rate limit headers)\n3. Trigger soft throttle (80-99% usage)\n4. Trigger hard reject (100%+ usage)\n5. Test authentication failures\n6. Access admin endpoints\n7. View metrics and documentation",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
